{
    "background_story": "Alice was a gentle soul with a deep love for herbs and botany. She spent most of her days tending to her garden, where she grew a variety of rare and exotic plants. Among her favorites was the calamint, a fragrant herb with delicate white flowers. Alice would often use calamint in her teas and potions, believing in its calming properties. As a skilled herbalist, she would help the villagers with their ailments, using her knowledge of plants to soothe their minds and bodies. One day, a terrible storm hit the village, causing widespread destruction. Alice's garden was ruined, but she managed to save a few precious calamint plants. She used them to create a special tea, which she distributed among the villagers, helping to calm their nerves and restore their sense of peace.",
